    "description": "Attention investors! Elegant 4-unit Inner Sunset building in A+ location tucked between GG Park & UCSF with tons of upside potential is now available! This property checks all the boxes for an excellent value-add opportunity, especially for its proximity to UCSF where the current Parnassus Renovation, including new hospital, is projected to be complete by 2030 and is estimated to bring 1,050 to 1,200 jobs for construction and 1,400 new employees who will need housing, according to  sfyimby.com. Featuring: one (1) 3-bedroom/1-bathroom unit + three (3) 1-bedroom / 1-bath units. Currently all units are leased! Additionally, there is abundant storage and a large, mature yard. This property hits all the marks for an excellent value-add opportunity. Quintessential craftsman details abound with units featuring a mix of: box-beam ceilings, brick fireplaces, buffet built-ins, bay windows & wood floors. Property is situated east to west, basking in natural sunlight. Located in the highly-sought after Inner Sunset within walking distance to: UCSF, GG Park hiking/biking trails + world-class museums, N-Judah for transport to the Financial District and Ocean Beach; Cole Valley, Haight Ashbury & more to enj"
